  "id": "broad-bean-pea-and-ricotta-frittata",
  "name": "Broad Bean, Pea and Ricotta Frittata",
  "subtitle": "A vegetable-filled egg dish with lemon, dill, and ricotta",
  "description": "Tender potatoes, peas, and broad beans are folded into herbed eggs and finished under the grill with ricotta.",
